# Claude Code local state: settings.local.json (per-machine permissions) and
# worktrees/ (harness-managed agent checkouts). Shared project config that
# SHOULD be committed lives in AGENTS.md and .mcp.json, not here.
.claude/

# signoff.md — ephemeral, personal cross-session handoff; never commit.
# Shared working notes live in docs/issues.md and docs/devlog.md.
signoff.md

# Per-context continuity files (kaijutsu-chan.md etc.) — the same ephemeral
# handoff pattern as signoff.md, but written by a kernel context about itself
# so it survives its own restarts. Never commit.
*-chan.md

# docs/kaijutsu-agent-feedback.md — the agent-experience log, cycled directly
# rather than versioned; agents rewrite it in place and it never lands in git.
docs/kaijutsu-agent-feedback.md

# backups/ — pre-deploy copies of the kernel db triple, taken before every
# bounce that could change durable state. Each one is the whole database
# (~800 MB today), so a stage-everything command that swallowed this
# directory would be unrecoverable in review. Local safety net, never
# versioned; prune it by hand.
backups/
